OL,3,AJD Vance casts doubt on firing squad
OL,4,Aexecution and says he will not watch it
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS Vice-President JD Vance has cast
OL,7,Fdoubt on the Pentagon's plans to
OL,8,Flivestream a firing squad execution of
OL,9,Fthe Fort Hood attacker.
OL,11,FVance expressed uncertainty to
OL,12,Freporters about whether the December
OL,13,Fexecution would go ahead as planned,
OL,14,Fsaying: "I don't know that that's
OL,15,Factually going to happen". He added,
OL,16,Fthat "if it's through live stream, I'm
OL,17,Fnot going to be watching it".
OL,19,FHours later, President Donald Trump
OL,20,Fsaid he "absolutely" approved the live
OL,21,Fstream plans but the Pentagon was still
OL,22,F"making a determination" on it.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
