OL,3,AJD Vance casts doubt on firing squad
OL,4,Aexecution and says he will not watch it
OL,5,
OL,6,FNidal Hasan killed 13 unarmed soldiers
OL,7,Fat a base in Texas in 2009, injuring
OL,8,Fanother 32. The firing squad execution
OL,9,Fwould be the first military execution
OL,10,Fin more than 60 years.
